{title: Dheere Dheere Se}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Anuradha Paudwal}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Dheere Dheere Se [G]Meri Zindagi Mein Aana
[Am]Dheere Dheere Se Mere Dil Ko Churaana
[Am]Tum Se Pyaar Humein [G]Kitna Hai Jaane Jaana
[Am]Tumse Milkar Tumko Hai Bataana
[Am]Jabse Tujhko Dekha Dil [G]Ko Koi Aaraam Nahin
[G]Mere Hothon Pe Ek [Am]Tere Siva Koi Naam Nahin
[Am]Apna Bhi Haal [G]Tumhare Jaisa Hai Saajan
[G]Bas Yaad Tujhe Karti [Am]Hoon Aur Koi Kaam Nahin
[Am]Ban Gaya Hoon [G]Main Tera Deewana
[Am]Dheere Dheere [G]Se Mere [Am]Dil Ko Churaana..
[Am]Tune Bhi Aksar [G]Mujhko Jagaya Raaton Mein
[G]Aur Neend Churayi [Am]Meethi Meethi Baaton Mein
[Am]Tune Bhi Beshak [G]Mujhe Kitna Tadpaya
[G]Phir Bhi Teri Har [Am]Ek Ada Par Pyaar Aaya
[Am]Aaja Aaja [G]Ab Kaisa Sharmaana
[Am]Dheere Dheere [G]Se Mere [Am]Dil Ko Churaana..
